{"type":"message","id":"0ef8adcb","parentId":"10782673","timestamp":"2026-03-31T05:57:31.235Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Chrome is running with CDP and I can see the target page with ID `BC724F96C147687A8791C556D736C152` and URL `https://gez.dongguanbank.cn/landlord/#/login`. Now I need to use the Chrome DevTools Protocol to fill in the login form. I'll use the WebSocket connection to send CDP commands.\n\nI need to:\n1. Use DOM.getDocument to get the document\n2. Use DOM.querySelector to find the username and password input fields\n3. Use DOM.setAttribute or Input.dispatchKeyEvent to fill in the values\n\nLet me write a PowerShell script that uses WebSockets to connect to the CDP and execute the necessary commands to fill in the form fields.\n\n\nI'll need to install the `Microsoft.PowerShell画廊` WebSocket client or use a .NET WebClient to establish the connection. First, let me query the page to see what form fields are actually available.","thinkingSignature":"7e3ae1be253de3b05844364593b161ffd14fbfa89a0dab7d0059a627b11e40a6"},{"type":"text","text":"Chrome已打开并进入登录页面。现在我用 CDP 协议来自动填充账号密码。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_9bhu9btjt3xu_1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.openclaw\\workspace\\fill_login.ps1","content":"# CDP fill login form\n$wsUrl = \"ws://localhost:9222/devtools/page/BC724F96C147687A8791C556D736C152\"\n\n$scriptDir = Split-Path -Parent $MyInvocation.MyCommand.Path\n$wsDll = Join-Path $scriptDir \"websocket-client\\Newtonsoft.Json.dll\"\n$wsClientDll = Join-Path $scriptDir \"websocket-client\\WebSocketClient.dll\"\n\nAdd-Type -AssemblyName System.Net.Http\nAdd-Type -AssemblyName System.Web\n\nfunction Get-CdpWebSocket($port, $pageId) {\n    $json = Invoke-RestMethod \"http://localhost:$port/json\" -TimeoutSec 5\n    $target = $json | Where-Object { $_.id -eq $pageId }\n    if ($target) {\n        return $target.webSocketDebuggerUrl\n    }\n    return $null\n}\n\n# Use .NET WebSocket directly\n$ws = New-Object System.Net.WebSockets.ClientWebSocket\n$cancellationToken = [Threading.CancellationToken]::None\n\ntry {\n    Write-Host \"Connecting to: $wsUrl\"\n    $connectTask = $ws.ConnectAsync($wsUrl, $cancellationToken)\n    $connectTask.Wait(5000)\n    if (-not $connectTask.IsCompleted) {\n        Write-Host \"Connection timeout\"\n        exit 1\n    }\n    Write-Host \"Connected!\"\n} catch {\n    Write-Host \"Failed to connect: $_\"\n    exit 1\n}\n\nfunction Send-CdpCommand($ws, $cmd, $id) {\n    $json = $cmd | ConvertTo-Json -Compress\n    $bytes = [Text.Encoding]::UTF8.GetBytes($json)\n    $arraySegment = New-Object ArraySegment[byte]($bytes)\n    $sendTask = $ws.SendAsync($arraySegment, [Net.WebSockets.WebSocketMessageType]::Text, $true, $cancellationToken)\n    $sendTask.Wait(1000)\n}\n\nfunction Recv-CdpResponse($ws) {\n    $buffer = New-Object byte[] 32768\n    $segment = New-Object ArraySegment[byte]($buffer)\n    $recvTask = $ws.ReceiveAsync($segment, $cancellationToken)\n    $recvTask.Wait(5000)\n    if ($recvTask.IsCompleted -and $recvTask.Result.Count -gt 0) {\n        $text = [Text.Encoding]::UTF8.GetString($buffer, 0, $recvTask.Result.Count)\n        return $text\n    }\n    return $null\n}\n\n# 1. Get document\nWrite-Host \"Getting document...\"\nSend-CdpCommand $ws @{id=1; method=\"DOM.getDocument\"} 1\n$resp = Recv-CdpResponse $ws\nWrite-Host \"Doc: $resp\"\n\n# 2. Query selector for username\nSend-CdpCommand $ws @{id=2; method=\"DOM.querySelector\"; params=@{nodeId=1; selector=\"#username, input[name=username], input[type=text], .username, [placeholder*=账号], [placeholder*=用户名]\"}} 2\n$resp = Recv-CdpResponse $ws\nWrite-Host \"Selector result: $resp\"\n\n# Wait and close\nStart-Sleep -Seconds 1\n$closeTask = $ws.CloseAsync([Net.WebSockets.WebSocketCloseStatus]::NormalClosure, \"Done\", $cancellationToken)\n$closeTask.Wait(1000)\nWrite-Host \"Done\"\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":2508,"output":985,"cacheRead":19925,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23418,"cost":{"input":0.0007524,"output":0.0011819999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0011955,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0031298999999999997}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774936624687,"responseId":"061a95311fe34c01578bd9126c9ce911"}}
