{"type":"message","id":"ebb2f936","parentId":"3fe2301a","timestamp":"2026-03-31T05:58:30.019Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The UIA approach didn't find the input fields inside Chrome's renderer process because Chrome renders content in its own process and the UI Automation tree doesn't expose internal web page elements. The Omnibox (address bar) was found but not the web page inputs.\n\nI need to use the Chrome DevTools Protocol (CDP) to interact with the page's DOM directly. Let me write a better script that uses CDP WebSocket to:\n1. Get the DOM\n2. Find the input fields\n3. Set their values\n\nThe CDP connection is already established (we saw the page ID `BC724F96C147687A8791C556D736C152`). Let me write a proper CDP client using .NET WebSocket.","thinkingSignature":"3a581d23b1c404d42192d8e5148e731700c8b8b00883cc9e496fdbd518bd3cd4"},{"type":"text","text":"Chrome的UI自动化找不到网页内的输入框（Chrome渲染机制限制）。让我用CDP协议直接操作网页DOM：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_mgu9uu1bgo3n_1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.openclaw\\workspace\\cdp_fill.ps1","content":"$pageId = \"BC724F96C147687A8791C556D736C152\"\n$wsUrl = \"ws://localhost:9222/devtools/page/$pageId\"\n\n$username = \"18926879306\"\n$password = \"100911yzpYZP\"\n\n# CDP message ID\n$msgId = 1\n\nfunction Get-NextId() {\n    $script:msgId++\n    return $script:msgId\n}\n\n# Build CDP command frame\nfunction Build-Frame($id, $method, $params) {\n    $obj = @{id=$id; method=$method}\n    if ($params) { $obj.params = $params }\n    $json = $obj | ConvertTo-Json -Compress\n    $bytes = [Text.Encoding]::UTF8.GetBytes($json)\n    return ,$bytes\n}\n\n# Parse CDP response frame\nfunction Parse-Frame($data, $len) {\n    if ($len -le 2) { return $null }\n    return [Text.Encoding]::UTF8.GetString($data, 0, $len)\n}\n\n$ws = New-Object System.Net.WebSockets.ClientWebSocket\n$ct = [Threading.CancellationToken]::None\n\ntry {\n    $ws.ConnectAsync($wsUrl, $ct).Wait(5000)\n    if ($ws.State -ne 'Open') { throw \"Connection state: $($ws.State)\" }\n    Write-Host \"Connected to CDP\"\n} catch {\n    Write-Host \"WS connect failed: $_\"\n    exit 1\n}\n\n# Helper: send and receive one response\nfunction Invoke-Cdp($method, $params) {\n    $id = Get-NextId\n    $frame = Build-Frame $id $method $params\n    $segment = New-Object ArraySegment[byte]($frame)\n    $ws.SendAsync($segment, [Net.WebSockets.WebSocketMessageType]::Text, $true, $ct).Wait(1000)\n    \n    $buf = New-Object byte[] 65536\n    $seg = New-Object ArraySegment[byte]($buf)\n    $r = $ws.ReceiveAsync($seg, $ct).Wait(3000)\n    if ($r.IsCompleted) {\n        $txt = [Text.Encoding]::UTF8.GetString($buf, 0, $r.Result.Count)\n        $j = $txt | ConvertFrom-Json\n        return $j\n    }\n    Write-Host \"No response for $method\"\n    return $null\n}\n\n# 1. Enable DOM domain\n$r = Invoke-Cdp \"DOM.enable\" @{}\nWrite-Host \"DOM.enable: $($r | ConvertTo-Json)\"\n\n# 2. Get document\n$r = Invoke-Cdp \"DOM.getDocument\" @{}\nWrite-Host \"Doc result: $($r | ConvertTo-Json)\"\n\n# 3. Find username input - try common selectors\n$r = Invoke-Cdp \"DOM.querySelectorAll\" @{selector=\"input\"}\nWrite-Host \"All inputs: $($r | ConvertTo-Json)\"\n\n# Try to find the form inputs by trying selectors\n$selectors = @(\n    \"input[type='text']\",\n    \"input[name='username']\",\n    \"input[placeholder*='账号']\",\n    \"input[placeholder*='手机']\",\n    \"input[id*='username']\",\n    \"input[class*='username']\",\n    \"input\",\n    \".login-input\",\n    \".el-input__inner\"\n)\n\nforeach ($sel in $selectors) {\n    Write-Host \"Trying selector: $sel\"\n    $r = Invoke-Cdp \"DOM.querySelectorAll\" @{selector=$sel}\n    $result = $r.result\n    if ($result -and $result.nodeIds -and $result.nodeIds.Count -gt 0) {\n        Write-Host \"Found $($result.nodeIds.Count) nodes for '$sel'\"\n        foreach ($nid in $result.nodeIds) {\n            $r2 = Invoke-Cdp \"DOM.describeNode\" @{nodeId=$nid}\n            Write-Host \"  Node $($nid): $($r2 | ConvertTo-Json)\"\n        }\n        break\n    }\n}\n\n# Close\n$ws.CloseAsync([Net.WebSockets.WebSocketCloseStatus]::NormalClosure, \"done\", $ct).Wait(1000)\nWrite-Host \"Done\"\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":5039,"output":1127,"cacheRead":19925,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26091,"cost":{"input":0.0015117,"output":0.0013524,"cacheRead":0.0011955,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0040596}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774936682504,"responseId":"061a956a3a87ad4faa69d33006dd905d"}}
